.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# face crops, the FAISS index and the named attendance reports are biometric
# records of real students -- they stay off GitHub. Share them out of band.
# Pinned model weights are the one exception: sourcing them is a trap.
data/*
!data/models/
# ultralytics drops the .pt and its .onnx export in the cwd; the copy the app
# loads is the tracked data/models/yolo11n.onnx. Safe to delete.
# leading slash: unanchored, these would also match data/models/yolo11n.onnx
/yolo11n.pt
/yolo11n.onnx
